## {m.gs_import_components_title()}

{m.gs_import_components_description()}

```svelte
<script>
  import { Button } from 'fluentui-svelte';
</script>
```

### {m.gs_namespace_import_title()}

{m.gs_namespace_import_description()}

```svelte
<script>
  import * as FluentUISvelte from 'fluentui-svelte';
</script>

<FluentUISvelte.Button>
  Click me
</FluentUISvelte.Button>
```

